  "source": {
    "kbid": "mac-operator-mcp",
    "kb_id": "90f1df58-87f6-4f47-aa9a-2881c478f8a0",
    "kb_item_id": "3806d4fd-b627-41b8-874c-e07af88674e9",
    "source_text": "Purpose: bounded process inventory. Input: limit?:1..500, sort?:cpu|memory|pid|name. Output: PID, executable identity, CPU/memory and safe owner metadata. Contract: L0 read_only; scope mac.process.read; target process_set; timeout 5000ms; cap 256KiB; no network/filesystem; process argv/env redacted by policy; approval trusted_read; idempotent yes. Phase 2 planned."
